WCH-derived first-party modifications
-------------------------------------

firmware/src/startup_CH592_phased.S is a modified copy of the WCH CH592 SDK
startup file. firmware/ld/ch592f.ld is based on the WCH CH592 SDK linker
script. Both identify their modifications and are distributed under
Apache-2.0 while retaining WCH provenance. The upstream startup file states:

  Attention: This software (modified or not) and binary are used for
  microcontroller manufactured by Nanjing Qinheng Microelectronics.

OpenController targets a WCH CH592 microcontroller and complies with that
stated use condition.
